-cell-xs-12 react-page-cell-leaf"><div class="react-page-cell-inner react-page-cell-inner-leaf slate"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%"><div style="position:relative;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word"><p></p></div></div></div></div><div class="react-page-cell react-page-cell-sm-10 react-page-cell-xs-12 react-page-cell-leaf"><div class="react-page-cell-inner react-page-cell-inner-leaf slate"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%"><div style="position:relative;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word"><h2>Our Mission</h2><p>The mission of the FSW Foundation is to support the strategic priorities of Florida SouthWestern State College by providing additional funding and resources.</p><h2>About FSW</h2><p>By offering students a full range of program and degree options and a wide array of funding opportunities to help with paying for college, FSW recruits hard-working and high-achieving students. Once here, FSW works hard to provide a full college experience that creates well-rounded graduates with an education focused on job placement. </p><h2>Support Our Students</h2><p>The FSW Foundation supplies millions of dollars in scholarships to students seeking to become the backbone of Southwest Florida&#x27;s workforce and economy. Support Southwest Florida&#x27;s future <a href="/foundation/donate">through a donation</a>. </p><p></p></div></div></div></div><div class="react-page-cell react-page-cell-sm-1 react-page-cell-xs-12 react-page-cell-leaf"><div class="react-page-cell-inner react-page-cell-inner-leaf slate"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%"><div style="position:relative;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word"><p></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="react-page-row"><div class="react-page-cell react-page-cell-sm-12 react-page-cell-xs-12 react-page-cell-leaf"><div class="react-page-cell-inner react-page-cell-inner-leaf"><div st